BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 653.77 Tm (The costliest firsthand failure belongs to Anatoliy Labinskiy's shoe store. The first Oxford shoe looked shiny) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 638.55 Tm (and premium in supplier pictures, tested as a winner, and was scaled to about 50K a month before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 623.32 Tm (chargebacks piled in because the shoe turned out to be plastic with no leather at all; the verdict was blunt,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 608.10 Tm (pictures are always lying, and the experience cost a lot [XED26wvEepA @ 00:03:36]. The fix taught) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 592.87 Tm (afterward: read YouTube comments and Amazon reviews before launch, then demand photo and video of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 577.65 Tm (the actual unit from the supplier once a product wins, and drop any supplier that refuses, because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 562.42 Tm (chargebacks freeze cash on PayPal, Stripe, and other platforms [XED26wvEepA @ 00:04:39]. Dean Alma) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 547.20 Tm (took losses on eBay from buyers claiming non-delivery with no way to prove receipt, and tells sellers to pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 531.97 Tm (for tracked shipping even at higher cost so the carrier record shuts down dishonest claims [GYROU1C9Mks) Tj ET
