BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 501.52 Tm (or alcoholic beverages can get a store flagged or blocked by its payment provider, so the provider's product) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 486.30 Tm (policy and destination-country rules get checked before listing [7GY4PPBU0GY @ 00:02:12].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 471.07 Tm (The unit economics of a single bad order are uglier than most sellers model. Dropshipping Deep Dive walks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 455.85 Tm (a $40 sale with $18 landed cost, about $1.46 in card fees, and roughly $12 in ad spend: on a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 440.62 Tm (refund-and-keep, the swing against the seller is roughly $70 versus where the order seemed to stand, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 425.40 Tm (the card fee never comes back [1L4TNDjsICQ @ 00:06:23]. A lost Shopify Payments chargeback stacks a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 410.17 Tm ($15 fee on top, the disputed amount leaves the next payout immediately, and providers start restricting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 394.95 Tm (accounts as the chargeback rate climbs toward 1% of transactions [1L4TNDjsICQ @ 00:08:13]. Supplier) Tj ET
